## Estimated Effort
High (4-5 days) - Complex math, extensive testing

## Testing Strategy
- Record real human interactions
- Compare automated vs human patterns
- Use behavior detection tools (e.g., CreepJS behavior tests)

## Risks
Risk: Too slow impacts performance
Mitigation: Configurable delays, fast mode for development

Risk: Sites detect Bezier curves as unnatural
Mitigation: Add noise/jitter to curves, use multiple curve types

Risk: Inconsistent with other stealth features
Mitigation: Integrate with TLS, fingerprint, session management

## Notes
This is what separates amateur scrapers from professional ones. Real humans are messy and inconsistent. Our automation should be too. This feature will add 2-5 seconds per action, but that is the cost of stealth.
